Received: from huawei.com (10.50.163.32) by kwepemr100010.china.huawei.com
 (7.202.195.125) with Microsoft SMTP Server (version=TLS1_2,
 cipher=TLS_ECDHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384) id 15.2.1544.36; Thu, 9 Jul
