> > > > > > > > > > > > +{
> > > > > > > > > > > > +	return ESR_ELx_ISS2(esr) & ESR_ELx_HDBSSF;
> > > > > > > > > > > This will return a long, which will be casted as bool.
> > > > > > > > > > > In general, what I see in the kernel is something like:
> > > > > > > > > > > 
> > > > > > > > > > > 	return !!(ESR_ELx_ISS2(esr) & ESR_ELx_HDBSSF)
> > > > > > > > > > ok!
> > > > > > > > > > 
> > > > > > > > > > 
> > > > > > > > > > > > +}
> > > > > > > > > > > > +
